ner-store availability requires recheck.","url":"https://hminnovations.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360034568152-Is-the-app-available-in-all-countries-What-languages-are-available","publisher":"Humin / Healthy Minds","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14"},{"seed_key":"meditation-h6-2026-10-15","source_type":"official","title":"H6 — Older support lists iOS 14+ / most Android 10+. Current App Store lists iOS 13.4+: preserve mismatch, do not choose a universal minimum.","url":"https://hminnovations.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360001259572-Which-mobile-devices-can-use-the-Healthy-Minds-Program-app","publisher":"Humin / Healthy Minds","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14"},{"seed_key":"meditation-h7-2026-10-15","source_type":"app_store","title":"H7 — Current US listing interface English, iOS 13.4+; account region/device not tested.","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/healthy-minds-program-by-humin/id1326310617","publisher":"Humin / Healthy Minds","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14"},{"seed_key":"meditation-m1-2026-10-15","source_type":"official","title":"M1 — Guided meditation, courses and other content; no paywall, no required account or payment according to vendor.","url":"https://meditofoundation.org/medito-app/","publisher":"Medito Foundation","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14"},{"seed_key":"meditation-m2-2026-10-15","source_type":"official","title":"M2 — AGPL applies to app code, not original audio. Original/partner content remains restricted; external reuse needs separate rights.","url":"https://meditofoundation.org/license/","publisher":"Medito Foundation","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14"},{"seed_key":"meditation-m3-2026-10-15","source_type":"app_store","title":"M3 — Developer listing documents session choice, playback and downloads; iOS 15+, English. Account-related release notes exist; no-account core does not mean no optional account features.","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/medito-mindfulness-meditation/id1500780518","publisher":"Medito Foundation","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14"},{"seed_key"